  "body": "As mentioned in https://github.com/w3c/resource-hints/issues/66, there's no current Request.destination defined for prefetched resources. We should probably define such a destination, to be able to:\r\n* Expose that destination to SW in a well-defined way.\r\n* Potentially define a prefetch-specific CSP directive, e.g. `prefetch-src` as suggested in https://github.com/w3c/webappsec-csp/issues/107",
